@startuml wifisec-serial-protocol
' WifiSec 串口协议时序：主机 ↔ ESP8266/ESP32 固件（115200 8N1，小端帧）
' 帧格式: [0xA5|0x5A][cmd][len_lo][len_hi][payload]
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #165DFF
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C9CDD4
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #E8F3FF
skinparam participantBorderColor #165DFF

participant "宿主机 wifisec" as Host
participant "ESP 协处理器固件" as ESP

== 打开端口 ==
Host -> ESP : DTR=0 / RTS=1 (100ms) 复位进入正常运行模式
note right : 驱动默认 DTR 电平会把\nNodeMCU 锁进下载模式，\n必须先做复位时序
ESP --> Host : 上电启动日志 (74880 波特, 视为噪声)

== 握手 ==
Host -> ESP : 0xA5 0x00 0x0000 (PING)
ESP --> Host : 0x5A 0x00 0x0002 [ver=1][caps] (PONG)
note right : caps bit0=1 表示支持 5GHz\n(仅 ESP32-C5)

== 扫描 ==
Host -> ESP : 0xA5 0x01 0x0000 (SCAN)
ESP -> ESP : WiFi.scanNetworks\n(阻塞 2-3s, LED 常亮)
loop 每个 AP
  ESP --> Host : 0x5A 0x01 len [bssid(6)][ch][rssi][ssidLen][ssid]
end
ESP --> Host : 0x5A 0x02 0x0000 (SCAN_DONE)

== 注入循环 (每 200ms) ==
loop 直到 SIGINT
  Host -> ESP : 0xA5 0x02 len [channel][802.11 deauth 帧]
  ESP -> ESP : wifi_send_pkt_freedom /\nesp_wifi_80211_tx
  note right : 无 ACK 回包——每条 ACK\n都占串口带宽，丢确认\n比丢帧更伤帧率
end

Host -> Host : Ctrl-C 输出统计并关闭端口
@enduml
